(text "INPUT: two-wire sensor + to J2.1, sensor - to J2.2.\nExternally powered source: signal to J2.2, return to J2.3.\nOUTPUT: passive receiver + to J3.1, receiver - to J3.2.\nDo not connect AO to an actively powered loop input." (at 20 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid 06019113-2112-5695-9a78-18aad3273acd))
(text "VIN24 -> protected 24 V + 3.3 V\nSENSOR_PWR: approximately 40 mA limit" (at 170 108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid de9943c8-657c-5a0a-b902-4749eb4d3c54))
(text "USB-C programming; 24 V board power required\nI2C, output enable and fault monitoring" (at 300 108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f6989a06-7169-5ec8-8804-e0a259d1b4b2))
(text "AI_IN -> limiter -> 100 ohm shunt -> ADC\nNominal range: 4-20 mA; measure 0-25 mA" (at 170 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f15be03d-8228-50ee-a935-122ae1f5599e))
(text "DAC -> XTR111 -> protected sourcing output\n4-20 mA into 0-500 ohms, including cable" (at 300 198 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8c397ed0-22d2-5feb-862b-fa006fe8fcb7))
(text "VALIDATION TARGETS\nRoom-temperature accuracy after calibration: +/-16 uA. 10 samples/s.\nBench-check miswire response, startup transients and loop compliance.\nNo IEC surge qualification or temperature accuracy claim at this revision." (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 00440ae4-e244-5beb-936b-15828dc8b6a9))
